 the commit in which the entry landed.
 
 Each test makes the situation in a small repository of its own, which holds this repository's gates and checkers and a
-reviews' page written as main writes it: the entry in one commit, its anchor in the next."""
+reviews' page written as main writes it: the entry in one commit, its anchor in the next.
